== 4. counterfactual: what a SECOND lanthanide on the excluded compounds would buy ==
  FROZEN                                                 90 extractants /  45 chemotypes / Kish 11.671  (1.00x)
  all 100 single-lanthanide compounds                  +100 ext -> 190 extractants /  98 chemotypes / Kish 12.271  (1.05x)
  only those in chemotypes absent from the cohort      + 60 ext -> 150 extractants /  98 chemotypes / Kish 28.553  (2.45x)
  only those with max ECFP4 Tanimoto to kept < 0.7     + 77 ext -> 167 extractants /  98 chemotypes / Kish 15.607  (1.34x)
  one compound per absent chemotype (cheapest batch)   + 53 ext -> 143 extractants /  98 chemotypes / Kish 27.375  (2.35x)
  HYPOTHETICAL: these need new laboratory measurements, not a filter change.
  Kish barely moves for 'all 100' because 28 of the 100 are themselves in sc009, the dominant diglycolamide chemotype (23 of the cohort's 90 extractants).

